@aspect_runtime_structure:definition text
This aspect positions KUs by the runtime entities, subsystems, and execution surfaces they define.
@aspect_runtime_structure:inclusion text
Include KUs that define commands, interpreters, state stores, routing surfaces, or architectural boundaries.
@aspect_runtime_structure:exclusion text
Exclude KUs that only mention a component name incidentally without defining its role or contract.
@aspect_runtime_structure:protocol text
Prefer KUs whose title, summary, or body explicitly defines a runtime component or boundary that the current request depends on.
@aspect_runtime_structure:role_vocabulary json
["primary definition", "supporting boundary note", "component overview"]
@aspect_runtime_structure:query_terms json
["runtime", "architecture", "component", "command", "interpreter", "boundary"]
